<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-GIO Australia ex-div boosts turnover.</title>
<headline>RTRS-GIO Australia ex-div boosts turnover.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in GIO Australia Holdings Ltd headed turnover lists early on Wednesday with 4.31 million shares traded as they went ex-dividend 10 cents.</p>
<p>The bulk of trade was in the form of options exercised prior to market's opening with about 4.3 million shares put through the market.</p>
<p>By 10.10 a.m. (2310 GMT), GIO shares were trading 14 cents lower at A$3.45 on turnover 4.31 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Walter Watson 61-2 9373 1810</p>
</text>
